          "content": "2026-09-28 · design catches up with #131 and the owner's decisions: Piece / Hidden, show all; \"Ocultar\" in the piece sheets; Notices / Critical in the Several grammar; no cm line on desktop editing; scenes regenerated with the new camera and shadows; 24 app captures retaken after #131 and #132 · K4, UI-6, UI-14",
